{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule11QueryFilterV","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryFilter"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter.swift#L36","fileName":"QueryFilter.swift"},"role":"symbol","title":"QueryFilter","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryFilter","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"generated":true,"title":"Filtering Queries","anchor":"Filtering-Queries"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryFilter"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a filter from a static method such as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":" and refine it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method"},{"type":"text","text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holds:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"drifter\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ghost\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","let moving = QueryFilter.with(Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)","let movingOrFrozen = QueryFilter.anyOf(.with(Velocity.self), .with(Frozen.self))","","let movingNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: moving).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\"]\"","","let movingOrFrozenNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: movingOrFrozen).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingOrFrozenNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\", \"statue\", \"ghost\"]\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass a filter to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/init(filter:)"},{"type":"text","text":", to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/filtered(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or as the "},{"code":"where","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"argument of "},{"code":"update(_:reading:where:body:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Queries, views and updates also offer the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods directly, so you can write "},{"code":"Query(Name.self).without(Frozen.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryfilter"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/init()"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/added(_:since:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/allowing(_:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/changed(_:since:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/merging(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/related(_:to:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/without(_:)-swift.method"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/added(_:since:)-swift.type.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/allowing(_:)-swift.type.method","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method